{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 对部分心理动机的因果解释有所压缩，例如 S01 害怕给对方造成负担、S08 当下的好不代表以后也好、S13 没有人能保证永远，这些地方不如 X 交代得充分。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的话语先突出心理动作和关键转折，重点字加亮，普通观众扫一眼就比较容易抓住每段发生了什么；感受词又能随着音乐出现，不必一次读完一大堆信息。水波、船、摇荡、靠岸等意象反复呼应，也让音乐感受和人物心境形成连续的变化，细节比 X 更具体、更贴合乐句。X 的优势是把人物为什么犹豫、害怕、改变解释得更完整，但综合实际观看体验，Y 更容易让人一边听音乐一边理解故事，并感受到细腻的情绪变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9ce3927f-771d-42fc-821c-a728f8994e30", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T090030364073Z", "elapsed_seconds": 69.953, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T09:01:40.321790+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7139980df8f412f46d1eaf6c4aae46d596623e83ade63e36b11d19b0b93454e0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc42223